title Home Assistant: a tile's name opens the entity page (study 053 section 7.6): the icon, the word and "room - changed" at the top, then the rows straight under it: the brightness slider (Left / Right by 10 %, the label whole at every size), Turn off, the favourite row (the lists' highlight and action dots)
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
tap "Ceiling light"
wait 600
shot light
check light
expect text "On, 72 %"
expect text "Brightness"
expect text "Turn off"
expect text "Remove from favourites"
expect text "72 %"
key right
wait 900
expect text "82 %"
shot slider
check slider
key left
key left
key left
wait 900
expect text "52 %"
shot slider-down
check slider-down
key down
wait 300
expect text "Turn off"
key enter
wait 800
expect text "Off"
expect text "Turn on"
# the rows laid out again (the action's words changed): the slider's label still whole
expect text "Brightness"
shot turned-off
check turned-off
key down
wait 300
expect text "Remove from favourites"
key esc
wait 500
expect text "Favourites"
expect text "Ceiling light"
expect noquit
